00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
Elvis is a drama, music, tv movie film directed by John Carpenter.

3
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:36,000
This biopic traces Elvis Presley’s life from his impoverished childhood to his
meteoric rise to stardom to his triumphant conquering of Las Vegas.

