10
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:06,000
Elvis is a 1979 American made-for-television biographical film aired on ABC.

11
01:55:30,000 --> 01:55:36,000
It is directed by John Carpenter and stars Kurt Russell as Elvis Presley, and
marked the first collaboration between Carpenter and Russell.

12
02:06:00,000 --> 02:06:06,000
After its success on television in the United States, a shorter re-edited version
of Elvis was released theatrically throughout Europe and Australia.

13
02:16:30,000 --> 02:16:36,000
It was nominated for a Golden Globe Award for Best Motion Picture Made for Television, and for three Primetime
Emmy Awards (including Outstanding Lead Actor in a Limited Series or a Special for Russell).

14
02:27:00,000 --> 02:27:06,000
The film explores themes of rock 'n' roll, rock
star, biography, singing, superstar.

15
02:37:30,000 --> 02:37:36,000
The tone is uplifting and emotional.
